{"4701030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Console Kingdom", "steam_appid": 4701030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4701030/extras/8ef916e6d83dfc4a01daa3cf76dc1522.avif?t=1786967984\" width=570 height=226 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Console Kingdom</strong> is a game in which you solve state problems on behalf of the king.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose one of three characters and complete quests. Make the right decisions and become beloved by your people. Rule the kingdom for as long as possible and go down in history as a wise and honest ruler.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAME FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three characters to choose from (Alaric the Wise, Magnus the Strong, Elara the Charming)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decisions with consequences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse outcomes of the king's reign</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various types of tasks to solve</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two languages ​​to choose from (Russian and English)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original game style</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4701030/extras/8ef916e6d83dfc4a01daa3cf76dc1522.avif?t=1786967984\" width=570 height=226 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Console Kingdom</strong> is a game in which you solve state problems on behalf of the king.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose one of three characters and complete quests. Make the right decisions and become beloved by your people. Rule the kingdom for as long as possible and go down in history as a wise and honest ruler.</p>